<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>State-Space Model</title><link>https://jaehun.me/tags/state-space-model/</link><description>딥러닝 컴파일러 엔지니어 류재훈의 기술 블로그. LLM 추론 최적화, KV 캐시, 컴파일러, C++와 AI 논문·오픈소스 코드 분석을 정리합니다.</description><language>ko-kr</language><atom:link href="https://jaehun.me/tags/state-space-model/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Mamba Drafters for Speculative Decoding</title><link>https://jaehun.me/posts/mamba-drafters-for-speculative-decoding/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jaehun.me/posts/mamba-drafters-for-speculative-decoding/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0900</pubDate><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a&#10; href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.01206v1"target="_blank"&#10; class="inline-flex items-center gap-1"&#10; &gt;논문 링크&lt;svg class="h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0" id="external-link" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"&gt;&lt;path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="-mamba-drafters-선형-ssm으로-외부-speculative-decoding-sota-다시-쓰기"&gt;📝 Mamba Drafters: 선형 SSM으로 외부 Speculative Decoding SOTA 다시 쓰기&lt;a href="#-mamba-drafters-%ec%84%a0%ed%98%95-ssm%ec%9c%bc%eb%a1%9c-%ec%99%b8%eb%b6%80-speculative-decoding-sota-%eb%8b%a4%ec%8b%9c-%ec%93%b0%ea%b8%b0" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h2 id="한-줄-요약-tldr"&gt;한 줄 요약 (TL;DR)&lt;a href="#%ed%95%9c-%ec%a4%84-%ec%9a%94%ec%95%bd-tldr" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Transformer 대신 &lt;strong&gt;Mamba SSM&lt;/strong&gt;을 외부 드래프터로 쓰고, &lt;strong&gt;트리 초안 + UCB 탐색&lt;/strong&gt;을 결합해 &lt;em&gt;재학습 없이&lt;/em&gt;도 Self-spec(EAGLE) 수준 속도·품질을 달성하며 메모리까지 절감했다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>